step Frostfire Hot Springs: kill these as you meet them
  zone Winterspring
  tip The western Winterfall camp sits in the hills between Salfa and Donova. Any furbolg here can drop an Empty Firewater Flask (about one in ten: it comes within the kills these quests need) and a Winterfall Ritual Totem (about one in thirty: it comes within the top-ups): right-click whichever drops. Keep the Runecloth the furbolgs drop for Meilosh.
  tip The rest of Winterspring's work is level 55-58: stay on this camp until level 54, so your first kills also count for Donova and Salfa. Or, with a group, run the Blackrock Depths dungeon instead.
  collect 12771                       -- Empty Firewater Flask
  accept 5083
  kill 7442 quest 5082.1              -- Winterfall Pathfinder
  kill 7440 quest 5082.2              -- Winterfall Den Watcher
  kill 7441 quest 5082.3              -- Winterfall Totemic
  kill 7440 quest 8464.2              -- Winterfall Den Watcher
  level 54 grind 7442                  -- grind on Winterfall Pathfinder

