# ---------------------------------------------------------------- The east

step Winterfall Village
  tip The Winterfall furbolg village lies east of Everlook: Shaman (56-57), Den Watchers (55-56) and Ursa (57-58), all above you. Kill the Shaman first, they heal, and pull from the edge. High Chief Winterfall in the cave at the back is elite: stay out.
  kill 7439 quest 8464.1              -- Winterfall Shaman
  kill 7440 quest 8464.2              -- Winterfall Den Watcher
  kill 7438 quest 8464.3              -- Winterfall Ursa

