step Corin's Crossing
  zone Eastern Plaguelands
  tip The Scourge around Corin's Crossing, west of the chapel, drop both kinds of Scourgestone; Darrowshire Spirits rise from them: talk to each one to free it.
  tip Careful: Eye of Naxxramas goes invisible when out of combat and calls Rockwing Gargoyles once a fight starts. Only 3 exist and they respawn every 15 min.
